  "content_html": "<div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/38db03c67bcfe35189.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"חלק-פאזל כסמל של אתגר מחשבה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"111\" data-original-width=\"133\" src=\"/assets/images/content/38db03c67bcfe35189.png\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h2><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הביטויים המקראיים השזורים בידיעות העיתונאיות הבאות.<br />כל ביטוי מורכב משתי מילים המוזכרות בחומש ויקרא פרק א'.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1📰</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/17f4389fbcfe4df8ec.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"150\" data-original-width=\"289\" height=\"127\" src=\"/assets/images/content/17f4389fbcfe4df8ec.gif\" width=\"245\" /></a></p></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">2📰</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/46516b318008b2eb20.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"160\" data-original-width=\"686\" height=\"100\" src=\"/assets/images/content/46516b318008b2eb20.gif\" width=\"428\" /></a></p></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">3📰</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/51fd9fa4ddeb0819af.gif\" style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"470\" data-original-width=\"416\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/51fd9fa4ddeb0819af.gif\" width=\"283\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4📰</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bfbd8a8d48ea44a08b.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"161\" data-original-width=\"260\" height=\"161\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bfbd8a8d48ea44a08b.gif\" width=\"260\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h2><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה פֶּדֶר?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">חֵלֶב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">פודרה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">אבא</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">דופן</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה מָלַק?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">אח של בלק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">התמנה למלך</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">עמלק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">חתך</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה שְׂאֹר?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">שער שמאלי</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">בצק חמוץ</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">שיער הקרבן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">החלק המיותר מהעור</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">מה זה&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">עָשַׁק</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">?</span></span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">הֵכִין שַׂק</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">הִשְׁתּוֹקֵק</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">גָּזָל</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">אָכַל קַשׁ</span></span></li></ol></ol></h3><p></p><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שאינו חי<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כתב את שמו לצורך אישור<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קבע את המחיר<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 סוג של מחבת (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 משכים\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 בעוד יומיים מאתמול\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שאינו מתוק</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1: \"</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְעָרַךְ הַכֹּהֵן אֹתָם <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">עַל הָעֵצִים</span> אֲשֶׁר עַל הָאֵשׁ\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">2:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"עֹלָה הוּא אִשֵּׁה <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">רֵיחַ נִיחֹחַ</span>\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3: \"</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּמָלַק <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אֶת רֹאשׁוֹ</span> וְהִקְטִיר הַמִּזְבֵּחָה\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"וְעָרְכוּ עֵצִים <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">עַל הָאֵשׁ</span>\"</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">1- חלב<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">2- חתך<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">3- בצק חמוץ<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">4- גזל</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מת, חתם, תמחר, מרחשת, משחר, מחר, מר</span></p></span></div></div></div><br />"
